        "content": "**Asynq queues** — Redis metrics from [asynqmon](https://github.com/hibiken/asynqmon) `--enable-metrics-exporter` (`/metrics`, `asynq_*`, job `asynqmon`). **Per-task-type** counts are not in Prometheus; **task type** panels use **Loki** (`compose_service=worker`) and structured JSON logs (`asynq task failed`, `task_type`). Success paths are not logged per task, so log panels reflect **failures** only.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "description": "Counts of `asynq task failed` log lines by `task_type` (worker JSON logs). Not total processed tasks.",
